      "side": 1,
      "message": "UpdateThresholdsInPlace() calls a new virtual Sensor::cancelPendingThresholds() before re-evaluating, which the ADC and PSU sensors[1] override to stop any pending ThresholdTimer, so a timer started against the previous values can no longer assert afterwards.\n\n[1]: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/94725",
